  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.22', 'Monitoring, review and change management of supplier services', 'Organizational', 'partial', '["org.subprocessor_dpa"]'::jsonb, 'org.subprocessor_dpa (partial): Not formally verified. Orcanos (the underlying data platform) holds ISO 27001 certification, which typically includes standard DPA-equivalent terms; Supabase and GCP both offer standard DPAs accepted via their terms of service. No one has explicitly confirmed the signed documents for this system (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.23', 'Information security for use of cloud services', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["supabase.network_restrictions", "org.subprocessor_dpa"]'::jsonb, 'supabase.network_restrictions (fail): The production Postgres database''s network restrictions allow 0.0.0.0/0 and ::/0 — no network-layer access control, relying solely on credential secrecy. | org.subprocessor_dpa (partial): Not formally verified. Orcanos (the underlying data platform) holds ISO 27001 certification, which typically includes standard DPA-equivalent terms; Supabase and GCP both offer standard DPAs accepted via their terms of service. No one has explicitly confirmed the signed documents for this system (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.24', 'Information security incident management planning and preparation', 'Organizational', 'partial', '["org.incident_response_plan"]'::jsonb, 'org.incident_response_plan (partial): A general incident response plan exists but does not explicitly name Orcanos QMS or its specific escalation path (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.25', 'Assessment and decision on information security events', 'Organizational', 'partial', '["code.audit_logging_review", "org.incident_response_plan"]'::jsonb, 'code.audit_logging_review (partial): security_audit_log mechanism implemented and wired into login failures and admin actions, but silently no-ops to stdout if migration 009 hasn''t been applied — not confirmed applied to production from code alone. | org.incident_response_plan (partial): A general incident response plan exists but does not explicitly name Orcanos QMS or its specific escalation path (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.26', 'Response to information security incidents', 'Organizational', 'partial', '["org.incident_response_plan"]'::jsonb, 'org.incident_response_plan (partial): A general incident response plan exists but does not explicitly name Orcanos QMS or its specific escalation path (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.27', 'Learning from information security incidents', 'Organizational', 'partial', '["org.incident_response_plan"]'::jsonb, 'org.incident_response_plan (partial): A general incident response plan exists but does not explicitly name Orcanos QMS or its specific escalation path (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.28', 'Collection of evidence', 'Organizational', 'partial', '["code.audit_logging_review"]'::jsonb, 'code.audit_logging_review (partial): security_audit_log mechanism implemented and wired into login failures and admin actions, but silently no-ops to stdout if migration 009 hasn''t been applied — not confirmed applied to production from code alone.', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.29', 'Information security during disruption', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["org.business_continuity"]'::jsonb, 'org.business_continuity (fail): This system''s backup/DR approach is configured but has not actually been tested with a real restore (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.30', 'ICT readiness for business continuity', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["supabase.backup_pitr", "org.business_continuity"]'::jsonb, 'supabase.backup_pitr (fail): Daily physical backups run reliably (8-day unbroken history), but Point-In-Time Recovery is disabled — recovery is limited to the most recent daily backup boundary (up to ~24h of potential data loss). | org.business_continuity (fail): This system''s backup/DR approach is configured but has not actually been tested with a real restore (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.31', 'Legal, statutory, regulatory and contractual requirements', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["org.legal_regulatory_requirements"]'::jsonb, 'org.legal_regulatory_requirements (fail): Applicable regulatory regimes (this system handles QMS/regulatory data for medical device customers — GDPR/HIPAA-adjacent exposure) have not been identified or mapped to specific controls (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.32', 'Intellectual property rights', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["org.legal_regulatory_requirements"]'::jsonb, 'org.legal_regulatory_requirements (fail): Applicable regulatory regimes (this system handles QMS/regulatory data for medical device customers — GDPR/HIPAA-adjacent exposure) have not been identified or mapped to specific controls (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.33', 'Protection of records', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["code.data_deletion_review", "supabase.backup_pitr"]'::jsonb, 'code.data_deletion_review (fail): delete_user() only removes the master users row — does not cascade to a user''s owned repositories/documents/conversations/usage_logs across accounts, and (unlike delete_account) returns no warning about what isn''t cleaned up. | supabase.backup_pitr (fail): Daily physical backups run reliably (8-day unbroken history), but Point-In-Time Recovery is disabled — recovery is limited to the most recent daily backup boundary (up to ~24h of potential data loss).', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.5.34', 'Privacy and protection of PII', 'Organizational', 'fail', '["code.data_masking_review", "code.data_deletion_review", "org.legal_regulatory_requirements"]'::jsonb, 'code.data_masking_review (fail): 19+ call sites in backend/api.py return raw exception text (str(e)) directly in HTTP responses — real information-disclosure gap (tracked internally as L1, still open). | code.data_deletion_review (fail): delete_user() only removes the master users row — does not cascade to a user''s owned repositories/documents/conversations/usage_logs across accounts, and (unlike delete_account) returns no warning about what isn''t cleaned up. | org.legal_regulatory_requirements (fail): Applicable regulatory regimes (this system handles QMS/regulatory data for medical device customers — GDPR/HIPAA-adjacent exposure) have not been identified or mapped to specific controls (user attestation, 2026-09-15).', '2026-09-15'),
