  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.8.19', 'Installation of software on operational systems', 'Technological', 'partial', '["code.change_management_review"]'::jsonb, 'code.change_management_review (partial): A defined Cloud Build pipeline exists (not ad hoc), but it does not enforce tests or a frontend build passing before the Cloud Run deploy step runs.', '2026-09-15'),
  ('orcanos-qms', 'A.8.20', 'Networks security', 'Technological', 'fail', '["pentest.security_headers", "supabase.network_restrictions"]'::jsonb, 'pentest.security_headers (partial): CORS avoids the wildcard-origin + allow_credentials=True combination (credentials hardcoded False), but allow_origins defaults to ''*'' in any deployment where ALLOWED_ORIGINS is unset (M2, tracked as not fully locked down). No CSP or HSTS header is set by the application itself. | supabase.network_restrictions (fail): The production Postgres database''s network restrictions allow 0.0.0.0/0 and ::/0 — no network-layer access control, relying solely on credential secrecy.', '2026-09-15'),
